# DESK13 run A -- Alt+C (point 5), then the text view, on the kernel desktop.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" armed the injector.
# A: idle, the boot picture.
# Alt+C: 0x38 = Alt make, 0x2E = C make, 0xAE = C break, 0xB8 = Alt break.
#   `check_alt_letter_key` must see the word 0x2E00 and open C:\ -> B.
# View title x 112..160; entry 1 "Show as text" at y = 19 + 1*16 = 35..51 -> C.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 key 38
1450 key 2e
1500 key ae
1550 key b8
2400 mark B_ALTC
2700 move 136 8
3100 move 140 43
3300 down
3303 up
3600 parkbr
4300 mark C_TEXT
